	(text "J4 custom harness to Waveshare SKU 27579 / 240 x 320\nST7789T3 LCD; identify actual CST328 / CST3530 touch revision.\nMap by signal name; board header order differs from module connector.\nLCD MISO is unused; module supply = 3.3 V.\n"
